{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/Header1StoreDemining.png?t=1744834560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work shifts for a mysterious military organization tasked with clearing mines that hinder an archaeological excavation in the middle of nowhere. Your main goal is to disarm mines to reach a set threshold while steadily losing your mind and ensuring at least one player makes it back to camp each shift\u2014alive. How you and your crew tackle the world\u2019s escalating challenges is up to you. Will you endure as many shifts as possible, or will you find a way to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/Header2StoreDemining.png?t=1744834560\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-4 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive, proximity-based voice chat.</strong> Find and repair radio towers throughout the world to extend radio range for your crew.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A non-linear, semi-open world</strong> that changes from day to day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly generated ruins</strong> lie beneath the world, waiting to be unearthed and looted. But beware\u2014terrible horrors may lurk inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A player status system </strong>built to always keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An infinitely scaling game loop,</strong> with the option to escape\u2014if you can find the means to do so.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716620?t=1744834560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716620?t=1744834560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.